WEBVTT

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:05.470
Go! Chaos Atlantal! Seize his Tachyon Dragon!

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:11.580
Tachyon Dragon!

00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:24.960
Their goal was to equip my Tachyon Dragon to your Chaos Atlantal

00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:30.600
to prevent me from Summoning Neo Tachyon
using this "The Seventh One"!

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:34.040
The Seventh One should be effectively omnipotent.

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:36.440
But they managed to figure out its fatal flaw.

00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:43.740
Ah~ ah~ No matter how ya slice it, 
a Dragon Tamer without a Dragon is useless.

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:45.800
How sleazy!

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:48.630
Your trump card is sealed.

00:00:48.630 --> 00:00:51.220
Well, how do you plan to fight now?

00:00:51.540 --> 00:00:54.920
It appears I've underestimated your power.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:59.180
You're fitting to be the brothers of IV and Kaito's master.

00:00:59.480 --> 00:01:02.110
But, I am one of the Seven Barian Emperors!

00:01:02.110 --> 00:01:04.110
This duel is not yet over!

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:09.550
WONDER WINGS, will you carry me...

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:14.790
...to an even brighter world, TAKE OFF!

00:01:22.370 --> 00:01:26.480
The Duel that decides our fate,

00:01:26.840 --> 00:01:30.660
now, show me your [Heart] CARD

00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:37.480
Words aren't enough to satisfy

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:41.460
the feelings I want to express.

00:01:44.390 --> 00:01:50.480
Beside you, I've always been dreaming the same

00:01:51.040 --> 00:01:53.730
Right now, with you

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:57.660
Oh - By facing each other,

00:01:57.990 --> 00:02:04.740
... to create a new future, let's Shining Draw!

00:02:05.720 --> 00:02:09.840
On WONDER WINGS, you carry me...

00:02:10.370 --> 00:02:15.270
... don't let us ever untie our hands,

00:02:16.540 --> 00:02:20.440
<i>Kattobing</i> from the sun...

00:02:21.340 --> 00:02:30.020
... on to an even brighter world, TAKE OFF TO THE FUTURE!

00:02:37.650 --> 00:02:41.740
I Normal Summon Heliosphere the Ultimate Shield Dragon

00:02:41.680 --> 00:02:46.140
<i>The Shadow of Chaos: Yuma vs Alito
The Tenacious Gladiator!</i>

00:02:41.780 --> 00:02:43.440
from my hand!

00:02:49.270 --> 00:02:52.900
You brought out a monster with 0 Attack in Attack Position!?

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:58.660
While Heliosphere is my only monster, 
my opponent cannot declare an attack.

00:02:59.460 --> 00:03:01.600
Well that explains that.

00:03:02.360 --> 00:03:06.680
I take you're trying to buy some time until 
you can get your hands back on Tachyon?

00:03:08.020 --> 00:03:11.610
I set one card face-down and end my turn!

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:20.980
III ... V ...

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:28.460
It's my turn! Draw!

00:03:29.340 --> 00:03:32.790
I activate the Trap Card, "Number Lift"!

00:03:33.150 --> 00:03:36.360
With this card I select a "Number" from my Graveyard,

00:03:36.460 --> 00:03:39.920
and Special Summon it with its effects negated!

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:42.650
Appear once more in the sky above us!

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:46.150
And shine forth the light of victory!

00:03:46.440 --> 00:03:48.260
Numbers 9!

00:03:50.520 --> 00:03:52.900
Dyson Sphere, the Canopy Star!

00:03:55.360 --> 00:03:59.460
And now, I activate the Normal Spell Card "Return Rank Up"!

00:04:00.180 --> 00:04:04.300
This card selects one "Rank-Up-Magic" 
card in my Graveyard,

00:04:04.340 --> 00:04:06.720
and returns it to my hand!

00:04:08.200 --> 00:04:11.760
I chose the "Argent Chaos Force" in the Graveyard,

00:04:12.660 --> 00:04:15.500
return it to my hand, and then activate it once more!

00:04:21.200 --> 00:04:26.060
I overlay my Rank 9 "Dyson Sphere"!

00:04:26.940 --> 00:04:30.480
Using this single monster, I rebuild the Overlay Network!

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:36.740
Chaos Xyz Change!

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:43.780
Come forth! Chaos Number 9!

00:04:46.620 --> 00:04:51.060
O star that covers the whole of heaven, that 
now carries the whole of creation inside itself...

00:04:51.180 --> 00:04:52.980
Descend upon us here and now!

00:04:57.700 --> 00:05:01.080
Chaos Dyson Sphere, the Canopy Star of Ill Omen!

00:05:04.800 --> 00:05:10.680
Mizael, any monster that battles this monster becomes its Overlay Unit!

00:05:10.960 --> 00:05:11.800
What!?

00:05:12.260 --> 00:05:16.740
And, once per turn, for each Overlay Unit attached to this card,

00:05:16.800 --> 00:05:19.600
it inflicts 500 damage to my opponent!

00:05:21.120 --> 00:05:24.600
I get it... if it keeps increasing its Overlay Units...

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:29.980
It'll deal more and more damage with each passing turn.

00:05:30.740 --> 00:05:33.300
Whatta <i>nasty</i> monster that is...

00:05:34.280 --> 00:05:36.820
I'll admit it's a quite powerful monster,

00:05:37.740 --> 00:05:42.060
but as long as I control Heliosphere, there will be no battling.

00:05:42.760 --> 00:05:46.240
Currently, Chaos Dyson Sphere has a single Overlay Unit.

00:05:47.340 --> 00:05:52.140
On <i>what</i> turn do you plan to 
beat me by throwing 500 damage my way!?

00:05:52.710 --> 00:05:54.620
This turn, of course!

00:05:54.820 --> 00:05:55.880
What!?

00:05:56.600 --> 00:05:57.960
Did you forget already?

00:05:58.480 --> 00:06:02.140
There's another Chaos Monster on our side of the field.

00:06:02.940 --> 00:06:04.160
Impossible!

00:06:04.160 --> 00:06:07.320
I activate Chaos Atlantal's effect!

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:11.100
By forfeiting the Battle Phase this turn and 
using three Overlay Unit,

00:06:11.960 --> 00:06:15.140
our opponent's Life Points become 1.

00:06:15.340 --> 00:06:16.190
What!?

00:06:16.880 --> 00:06:19.620
His life points-
 -become <i>one</i>!?

00:06:37.760 --> 00:06:41.140
<i>Instead of inflicting Effect Damage, they rather...</i>

00:06:42.160 --> 00:06:44.120
<i>... set my Life Points to <i>one</i>...</i>

00:06:45.200 --> 00:06:47.360
So that's your aim!

00:06:47.640 --> 00:06:50.560
With this, Chaos Dyson Sphere's Effect will have it fixed!

00:06:50.980 --> 00:06:53.900
Chaos Dyson Sphere's Effect activates!

00:06:54.320 --> 00:07:00.120
Once per turn, I can inflict 500 damage 
for each Overlay Unit attached to this card!

00:07:00.960 --> 00:07:05.820
This is for Thomas, who risked his life to bring us this Duel Data.

00:07:06.460 --> 00:07:10.360
This is our power! The power of all three of us!

00:07:11.220 --> 00:07:13.160
Mizael, may you die an honorable death!

00:07:14.600 --> 00:07:18.740
Befitting the proud warrior of the Barian Emperors!

00:07:26.280 --> 00:07:28.920
Energy at 95%.

00:07:29.850 --> 00:07:31.800
All Systems Normal.

00:07:32.530 --> 00:07:36.820
314.25 seconds until we're ready to launch.

00:07:39.520 --> 00:07:41.520
Huh? Ka- Kaito-<i>sama</i>!

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:44.360
It appears from where V and III are dueling,

00:07:44.840 --> 00:07:47.080
some sort of energy is radiating.

00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:49.560
Understood.

00:07:49.680 --> 00:07:50.600
Huh!?

00:07:50.620 --> 00:07:52.520
Focus on preparing us for the launch.

00:07:52.580 --> 00:07:53.900
A- at your service!

00:08:00.860 --> 00:08:04.000
We did it! We took down one of the Seven Barian Emperors...

00:08:06.720 --> 00:08:07.680
Impossible!

00:08:09.280 --> 00:08:10.780
Wh- why!? How!?

00:08:11.420 --> 00:08:13.220
He still has Life Points!

00:08:14.500 --> 00:08:15.740
I was waiting for that.

00:08:16.440 --> 00:08:17.500
Waiting for what?

00:08:18.440 --> 00:08:21.900
I couldn't activate this unless Effect Damage was inflicted.

00:08:22.420 --> 00:08:24.920
The Counter Trap "Damage Rebound"!

00:08:26.140 --> 00:08:31.360
This card negates effect damage I would take from an opponent's card effect.

00:08:31.960 --> 00:08:33.440
A trap like that ...

00:08:33.730 --> 00:08:37.100
But that's not all! When that effect is activated...

00:08:37.900 --> 00:08:42.520
My opponent must target one face-up card they control

00:08:42.620 --> 00:08:45.960
and return that target to the Deck!

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:49.420
Also, if the chosen card is a Monster Card,

00:08:49.520 --> 00:08:51.820
its Attack is dealt as damage to your Life Points.

00:08:51.980 --> 00:08:53.200
What!?

00:08:53.500 --> 00:08:56.960
What is currently face-up on our field ...

00:08:57.520 --> 00:09:00.940
... is Chaos Atlantal and Chaos Dyson Sphere.

00:09:02.120 --> 00:09:04.680
With our remaining life at 2800,

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:08.180
if we return either to the Deck, our life will become 0.

00:09:08.770 --> 00:09:11.440
In order to avoid that damage...

00:09:12.150 --> 00:09:15.500
Correct. There's only one card you two can choose!

00:09:15.920 --> 00:09:18.200
Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon!

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:25.160
As the equipped Galaxy-Eyes Tachion Dragon is not treated as a Monster Card,

00:09:25.220 --> 00:09:27.900
therefore you would get no damage from this.

00:09:28.740 --> 00:09:32.300
The only way for you guys to get past the barrier of Heliosphere

00:09:32.420 --> 00:09:35.340
would have been to give me the final shot with effect damage.

00:09:35.700 --> 00:09:37.300
Hence "I was waiting for that".

00:09:37.520 --> 00:09:39.100
So he beat us there?

00:09:39.100 --> 00:09:42.960
Indeed, his tactics to lose the battle in order to win the war... is impressive.

00:09:44.100 --> 00:09:49.840
We choose to return the Equip "Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon" to your Deck.

00:09:56.240 --> 00:10:01.380
And now that it has no Equip, your Chaos Atlantal returns to its original Attack!

00:10:01.820 --> 00:10:03.960
However, this isn't over yet.

00:10:04.280 --> 00:10:07.020
I activate Chaos Dyson Sphere's effect!

00:10:08.200 --> 00:10:13.900
By using 1 Overlay Unit, I can inflict 800 points of damage to you!

00:10:17.500 --> 00:10:22.160
How tiresome! I activate the Continuous Trap Card "Damage Alteration"!

00:10:26.360 --> 00:10:32.040
When I would take damage due to a card effect, 
this card negates that effect damage!

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:40.720
Then, I Special Summon 1 Monster from my Deck
that has the same Attack as that damage.

00:10:41.180 --> 00:10:44.200
I Special Summon my "Parsec, the Interstellar Dragon"!

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:53.380
I set one card face down and end my turn.

00:10:59.460 --> 00:11:00.360
Nasch!

00:11:01.080 --> 00:11:02.040
Gilag?!

00:11:02.580 --> 00:11:04.480
Help me, Nasch!

00:11:07.020 --> 00:11:08.140
Gilag...?!

00:11:09.960 --> 00:11:11.380
No harm meant!

00:11:11.460 --> 00:11:14.420
There'll be trouble if you and Yuma fight.

00:11:15.080 --> 00:11:18.240
All for Don Thousand-<i>sama</i>'s sake.

00:11:19.140 --> 00:11:21.120
Don Thousand?

00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:26.080
My turn! Draw!

00:11:26.780 --> 00:11:31.240
I activate "Rank-Up-Magic: The Seventh One"!

00:11:32.120 --> 00:11:34.540
Manifest yourself, Number 107!

00:11:34.930 --> 00:11:37.600
Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon!

00:11:39.240 --> 00:11:40.640
Now, here I go!

00:11:42.580 --> 00:11:47.680
I overlay my Rank 8 "Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon"!

00:11:49.340 --> 00:11:52.820
I rebuild the Overlay Network with this one monster!

00:11:52.950 --> 00:11:54.620
Chaos Xyz Change!

00:11:56.620 --> 00:11:59.800
Descend before us, Chaos Number 107!

00:12:01.720 --> 00:12:06.780
Pierce through the surging galaxies and be reborn before the beginning of time!

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:09.640
The dragon star from beyond eternity!

00:12:10.840 --> 00:12:14.700
Neo-Galaxy Eyes Tachyon Dragon!

00:12:20.400 --> 00:12:21.520
That's ...

00:12:21.560 --> 00:12:23.960
... Neo Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon.

00:12:24.640 --> 00:12:27.920
I've never felt a monster with this kind of aura...

00:12:28.420 --> 00:12:31.140
The time of you curs' disappearance seems to have come.

00:12:34.740 --> 00:12:37.840
We won't give up until the very end!

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:41.260
I activate the Continuous Trap Card, "Monopoly Chain"!

00:12:41.940 --> 00:12:46.180
This card activates when I have Chaos Dyson Sphere on my side of the field!

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:48.700
It prevents my opponent's monster from attacking!

00:12:57.020 --> 00:13:00.880
And now, I activate the Continuous Trap Card "Atlantic Invitation"!

00:13:01.560 --> 00:13:05.680
This card requires us to have Chaos Atlantal on the field.

00:13:05.880 --> 00:13:09.320
If there's a turn in which our opponent's monster doesn't attack...

00:13:09.380 --> 00:13:10.940
... that monster is destroyed

00:13:11.140 --> 00:13:15.160
and its Attack is inflicted as damage to the opponent!

00:13:15.700 --> 00:13:18.920
And since his ability to attack is sealed,

00:13:19.100 --> 00:13:22.140
he'll be destroyed when this turn ends!

00:13:22.660 --> 00:13:28.060
And since I'd take Neo Tachyon's Attack as damage, I'd lose, correct?

00:13:28.510 --> 00:13:30.720
But that won't happen.

00:13:31.420 --> 00:13:34.310
As long as I have my Neo Tachyon!

00:13:35.280 --> 00:13:37.500
I activate my Neo Tachyon's effect!

00:13:37.850 --> 00:13:40.480
By using 1 Chaos Overlay Unit,

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:45.720
this card negates the effects of all other cards than this one until the end of this turn,

00:13:45.780 --> 00:13:48.650
and the Duel's Game State returns to how it was when the turn began!

00:13:49.140 --> 00:13:50.740
Time Tyrant!

00:13:54.960 --> 00:13:56.140
This is...!?

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:03.720
Now, all monster effects are unusable.

00:14:03.860 --> 00:14:09.140
However, Neo Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon is unaffected by this effect!

00:14:16.660 --> 00:14:18.020
That's insane...

00:14:18.200 --> 00:14:21.580
Since you rewound time, all the cards...

00:14:22.310 --> 00:14:25.440
Then I'll activate our Traps again!

00:14:25.600 --> 00:14:26.540
Useless!

00:14:27.260 --> 00:14:29.460
During the turn "Time Tyrant" is activated...

00:14:29.510 --> 00:14:33.120
... you cannot activate cards I don't want you to use!

00:14:33.180 --> 00:14:35.700
What!?
Then...!?

00:14:36.140 --> 00:14:39.700
This monster is the unquestioned ruler of Time itself!

00:14:40.040 --> 00:14:44.300
I activate my Neo Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon's other effect!

00:14:44.780 --> 00:14:48.760
By Tributing two monsters I control that haven't attacked,

00:14:49.120 --> 00:14:52.340
my Neo Tachyon can attack three times in a row!

00:15:04.060 --> 00:15:09.020
We'll escape the atmosphere in 58.03 Seconds.

00:15:10.440 --> 00:15:12.500
V ... III ...

00:15:21.060 --> 00:15:22.060
Brother.

00:15:22.340 --> 00:15:25.300
Yes. It appears we bought enough time.

00:15:25.840 --> 00:15:29.020
"Buy Time"? ... There's no way you curs...

00:15:29.160 --> 00:15:31.020
Correct. Kaito is...

00:15:31.100 --> 00:15:32.840
... heading for the moon.

00:15:33.020 --> 00:15:34.280
To the moon!?

00:15:34.960 --> 00:15:38.790
Meanwhile, Yuma and Astral are heading to the Barian World.

00:15:38.790 --> 00:15:39.580
What!?

00:15:41.760 --> 00:15:44.610
<i>Yuma... please handle the rest.</i>

00:15:44.740 --> 00:15:48.260
<i>We have to avenge our brother with our own hands.</i>

00:15:48.820 --> 00:15:51.400
<i>I'm not a coward like you!</i>

00:15:52.440 --> 00:15:56.300
<i>Yuma... I am fed up with... talking to you.</i>

00:15:58.300 --> 00:16:02.300
<i>If you regret this, try prove your way to us!</i>

00:16:03.540 --> 00:16:04.360
<i>Yuma...</i>

00:16:06.820 --> 00:16:09.010
Our work is now done.

00:16:09.220 --> 00:16:11.200
No, we're not done yet.

00:16:17.640 --> 00:16:19.280
Wha- what the...!?

00:16:19.340 --> 00:16:20.700
There's...

00:16:20.800 --> 00:16:22.200
III! V!

00:16:23.140 --> 00:16:25.660
Is this a Duel in progress?

00:16:26.280 --> 00:16:29.440
And is that... Mizael's Chaos Numbers!?

00:16:30.110 --> 00:16:32.280
Hey III, V!

00:16:33.080 --> 00:16:34.280
Brother?

00:16:34.340 --> 00:16:35.920
They're safe and on their way.

00:16:36.400 --> 00:16:40.120
But we have to burn into them, what a Duel with the Seven Emperors is like. And...

00:16:40.760 --> 00:16:46.180
Mizael! Yuma! I want you both to listen carefully to what I have to say.

00:16:46.720 --> 00:16:48.400
Kaito is headed toward the moon.

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:49.940
The moon?

00:16:50.160 --> 00:16:52.440
He's doing it to achieve something specific.

00:16:54.180 --> 00:16:59.760
Kaito had a hypothesis he concluded from the legend of the Dragons.

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:02.040
<i>What?</i>

00:17:02.420 --> 00:17:06.740
<i>You think the Numeron Code won't work without the proper Numbers?</i>

00:17:07.180 --> 00:17:08.040
<i>Correct.</i>

00:17:08.820 --> 00:17:12.900
<i>I checked out Jinlong's ruins again.</i>

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:19.980
<i>And I came across this stone monument that had Dragons carved on it.</i>

00:17:21.200 --> 00:17:25.080
<i>It read "Dragons of light and time, clash at thy place of birth.</i>

00:17:25.460 --> 00:17:30.540
<i>Then shall the eyes of the galaxies truly awaken for the first time, opening the gate to a new world."</i>

00:17:32.420 --> 00:17:34.220
<i>Or something like that.</i>

00:17:34.730 --> 00:17:36.360
<i>The "Dragons of Light and Time",</i>

00:17:36.620 --> 00:17:39.660
<i>it refers to both the Photon and Tachyon variants of the Galaxy-Eyes.</i>

00:17:39.950 --> 00:17:41.840
<i>But what about the "Thy place of birth"?</i>

00:17:42.240 --> 00:17:43.380
<i>It means the moon.</i>

00:17:43.440 --> 00:17:44.320
<i>The moon?</i>

00:17:44.400 --> 00:17:45.280
<i>Correct.</i>

00:17:45.380 --> 00:17:47.240
<i>So you plan to go there?</i>

00:17:47.600 --> 00:17:48.500
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:17:48.560 --> 00:17:49.530
<i>But...</i>

00:17:50.260 --> 00:17:52.520
<i>A duel of the two Galaxy-Eyes...</i>

00:17:53.100 --> 00:17:56.260
<i>lets the winner "Open the gate to a new world".</i>

00:18:00.360 --> 00:18:04.420
<i>I'm certain this has to do with how to use the Numeron Code.</i>

00:18:04.520 --> 00:18:06.060
<i>And I want to know...</i>

00:18:06.920 --> 00:18:08.920
<i>Which one of us really is</i>

00:18:09.180 --> 00:18:11.040
<i>the True Dragon Tamer...</i>

00:18:14.740 --> 00:18:16.320
Legend of the Dragons...

00:18:16.780 --> 00:18:18.000
I understand.

00:18:18.340 --> 00:18:22.480
So, in order to let Yuma and Kaito escape,

00:18:22.820 --> 00:18:25.480
you two stranded us in this Duel?!

00:18:26.340 --> 00:18:29.620
Then...! All that about taking revenge for IV was...

00:18:31.820 --> 00:18:33.780
Wait! III, V,

00:18:33.920 --> 00:18:34.930
I'll be right...!

00:18:34.980 --> 00:18:35.820
<i>Yuma!</i>

00:18:36.500 --> 00:18:38.160
<i>Don't do anything stupid!</i>

00:18:39.500 --> 00:18:43.340
<i>This is the true power of our enemy, the Seven Barian Emperors!</i>

00:18:43.940 --> 00:18:46.700
<i>Burn this into your eyes and keep going!</i>

00:18:47.960 --> 00:18:51.580
<i>Kotori... Thank you for the Duel Rice.</i>

00:18:52.560 --> 00:18:56.520
<i>And, give our regards to Yuma's sister and grandmother.</i>

00:18:56.830 --> 00:18:59.760
<i>Tell them the Rice was absolutely delicious.</i>

00:19:00.200 --> 00:19:01.220
III...

00:19:02.140 --> 00:19:03.320
<i>Yuma...</i>

00:19:03.660 --> 00:19:07.320
<i>I'm sorry I called you a disgusting coward.</i>

00:19:07.800 --> 00:19:09.420
<i>That wasn't how I really felt.</i>

00:19:09.640 --> 00:19:12.140
<i>Yuma, you're my true friend.</i>

00:19:12.640 --> 00:19:13.580
III...

00:19:15.300 --> 00:19:20.660
<i>Yuma ... I was glad I had the chance to meet you.</i>

00:19:23.360 --> 00:19:26.140
<i>Thank you so much ... and ...</i>

00:19:26.720 --> 00:19:27.900
<i>Goodbye...</i>

00:19:28.920 --> 00:19:30.940
III ... !!

00:19:31.680 --> 00:19:33.660
Have you two finished your goodbyes?!

00:19:35.540 --> 00:19:38.620
Go, Neo Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon!

00:19:38.980 --> 00:19:41.020
Attack Chaos Atlantal!

00:19:41.370 --> 00:19:44.240
Ultimate Tachyon Spiral!

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:48.660
STOP IT!

00:19:56.930 --> 00:19:59.940
Next, attack Chaos Dyson Sphere!!

00:20:21.560 --> 00:20:24.800
Yuma... Finish the rest.

00:20:26.100 --> 00:20:28.540
We'll always be with you...

00:20:28.980 --> 00:20:31.840
By your side, in your "<i>Kattobingu</i>" Soul.

00:20:33.420 --> 00:20:35.720
III... V...

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:39.240
Neo Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon!

00:20:39.420 --> 00:20:42.520
Attack both of them directly!

00:21:06.240 --> 00:21:08.680
Kaito-<i>sama</i>... Their vitals have...

00:21:08.880 --> 00:21:10.080
Understood.

00:21:18.780 --> 00:21:21.500
Farewell, proud brothers.

00:21:40.720 --> 00:21:42.760
Are you going? To there?

00:21:42.840 --> 00:21:43.520
Yes.

00:21:45.160 --> 00:21:48.520
My greatest enemy is waiting.

00:21:51.120 --> 00:21:52.470
Yuma...

00:21:52.920 --> 00:21:54.780
Yuma, lift your head high.

00:21:55.340 --> 00:21:57.540
Everyone's placed their trust in you.

00:21:58.440 --> 00:21:59.360
I know...

00:22:00.100 --> 00:22:02.660
I do know... I know...

00:22:09.820 --> 00:22:10.180
{marker}

00:22:10.180 --> 00:22:11.830
In the present, past and future,

00:22:11.830 --> 00:22:16.230
We are wishing upon the shards of dreams

00:22:16.290 --> 00:22:18.510
'Til we can grab hold of them

00:22:18.530 --> 00:22:22.180
Challenge the GAME!

00:22:23.950 --> 00:22:24.800
Let it go.

00:22:35.190 --> 00:22:38.070
When there's a problem that can't be beaten,

00:22:38.930 --> 00:22:43.280
We'll just try again.

00:22:45.180 --> 00:22:49.190
You keep holding your heart inside your chest

00:22:49.190 --> 00:22:54.530
It's the power you get from keeping the faith.

00:22:54.680 --> 00:22:59.360
Even while you're discouraged and crying

00:22:59.780 --> 00:23:05.270
Let's try to secure tomorrow with our bonds

00:23:05.530 --> 00:23:07.430
We can shatter anything

00:23:07.430 --> 00:23:11.800
Fear and fate and even the most fervent fantasies

00:23:12.100 --> 00:23:15.680
Keep on burning as you break through!

00:23:15.780 --> 00:23:17.430
In the Present, Past and Future

00:23:17.500 --> 00:23:21.900
We are wishing upon the shards of dreams

00:23:21.980 --> 00:23:24.030
Let's go and reach out

00:23:24.190 --> 00:23:26.850
Beyond the limits

00:23:27.000 --> 00:23:29.290
'Til we can grab hold of them,

00:23:29.290 --> 00:23:32.800
Challenge the GAME

00:23:41.160 --> 00:23:44.040
A crimson light has strike towards us.

00:23:44.120 --> 00:23:47.440
The caster of the light that stands in our way to Barian,

00:23:47.480 --> 00:23:49.520
is my former friend, Alit!

00:23:50.020 --> 00:23:52.220
I don't wish to fight you!

00:23:52.300 --> 00:23:54.320
The one over there... is Don Thousand!

00:23:54.320 --> 00:23:55.700
...or Alit?

00:23:55.740 --> 00:23:58.280
Will the Number from the ruin become the breakthrough?

00:23:58.900 --> 00:24:01.220
Next, Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal II:

00:24:01.240 --> 00:24:04.980
The Shadow of Chaos, Yuma vs Alit the Determined Fighter.

00:24:05.290 --> 00:24:08.060
Hurry and remember our friendship!
